194	    /**
195	     * Handles {@link DailyOwnerLimitReachedException} thrown when an owner is created after the
196	     * maximum number of owners for the day (100), counted by {@code registrationDate}, has already
197	     * been reached. Returns a 429 Too Many Requests.
198	     *
199	     * @param e The {@link DailyOwnerLimitReachedException} to be handled
